      {
        "name": "conexus_overview",
        "description": "The company in Conexus now: its Projetos by name, at most 50, with whether its app is published and the version people use, and moreProjects true when it has more; and each connection this conversation's place offers that the person reaches (a table to read or an operation to use), with whether this conversation chose it.",
        "input_schema": {
          "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {},
